---
permalink: /404.html
lang: de
routeKey: home
noindex: true
sitemap: false
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
title: "Seite nicht gefunden — DIWEBA"
description: "Diese Seite existiert nicht oder wurde verschoben."
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#
  Bilingual 404.

  Cloudflare serves this for unmatched routes with a genuine 404 status — the
  Worker sets the status code; serving it as 200 would let Google index an error
  page (spec §10).

  Both languages appear because the failed URL may be in either, and a German-only
  error page is unhelpful to an English visitor who mistyped a /en/ path.

  routeKey is `home` purely so the layout's canonical/hreflang machinery has a
  valid entry to resolve; the page itself is noindex and excluded from the
  sitemap, so neither is used for indexing.
#}
{#- Phase 4 audit fix: this page used class="section", which is not a real
    class anywhere in components.css/base.css -- every other page's content
    is inset with .row's padding-inline, so this one alone rendered flush to
    the viewport edge with unstyled default heading sizes. Switched to the
    same .row/.container/.stack tokens (and explicit heading sizes) every
    other page already uses -- no new visual language, just the one this
    page was missing. -#}
<section class="row row--no-border">
  <div class="container container--narrow stack" style="gap:var(--space-lg)">

    <div class="stack">
      <h1 style="font-size:var(--text-3xl)">{{ ui.de.error404.title }}</h1>
      <p class="text-soft" style="font-size:var(--text-md)">{{ ui.de.error404.body }}</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ routes.home.de }}">{{ ui.de.error404.back }}</a></p>
    </div>

    <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);width:100%">

    <div class="stack" lang="en">
      <h2 style="font-size:var(--text-2xl)">{{ ui.en.error404.title }}</h2>
      <p class="text-soft" style="font-size:var(--text-md)">{{ ui.en.error404.body }}</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ routes.home.en }}">{{ ui.en.error404.back }}</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
